  "separate_addresses_note": "Ten more Houston locations, added 2026-11-14 by tools/crosscheck_addresses.py: public map coordinates chosen to span loud to quiet (by freeways, by arterials, on residential streets, near Hobby Airport), not taken from sponsor data. our_outdoor_dnl is the model's outdoor free-field road DNL at the point from every counted road within 800 m in TxDOT's public 2020 Roadway Inventory (research R7). A divided highway is counted once. HowLoud scores are from the official API, key from a local HOWLOUD_API_KEY. `road` is the busiest road in range. These ten were not used to fit the diagnostic line.",
